  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water-Energy-Food (WEF) Nexus in the West Bank</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of this project is to integrate solar into WBWDB&#x2019;s wells facilities to enhance its operational sustainability through utilizing generated saving from reduction of electricity consumption in undertaking preventive maintenance of these facilities. This project intends to achieve the following outputs, with a view to contribute to the longer-term and higher-level results of improved sustainable and climate resilient management of and equitable access to natural resources, including renewable energy.</narrative>
  </description>
